    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:25:09.095+09:00">最初创造生命的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:25:12.751+09:00">是天；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:25:16.469+09:00">养育生命并使它成长的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:25:21.05+09:00">是人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:25:29.713+09:00">能够颐养上天创造的生命使它不受到摧残的人被称作天子。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:05.875+09:00">天子的任何举动</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:10.079+09:00">都是出于保全生命的天性的目的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:27.252+09:00">这也是设置官吏的由来。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:37.359+09:00">天子设置官吏正是为了保全生命的天性。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:49.933+09:00">当今世上昏庸的君主设置了许多官吏，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:53.733+09:00">却反而伤害了生命的天性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:26:57.158+09:00">这就失去了设置官吏的意义了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:27:24.026+09:00">譬如训练军队</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:27:27.986+09:00">本是用以防备敌寇的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:27:34.345+09:00">可如今训练军队却反而用于自我攻伐，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:27:34.593+09:00">那也就失去了训练军队的意义了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:27:52.984+09:00">水的本性是清澈的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:00.437+09:00">由于泥土使它变得混浊，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:04.216+09:00">所以不能保持清澈。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:08.316+09:00">人的天性是能够长寿的， </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:12.831+09:00">由于有外物干扰它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:28.674+09:00">所以不能长寿。外物</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:51.875+09:00">本来</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:28:56.496+09:00">是用于颐养天性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:03.924+09:00">而不该损耗天性去追逐它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:15.986+09:00">可是如今世上昏庸的人</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:19.769+09:00">大多损耗天性去追逐外物， </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:24.278+09:00">那就是不知道轻重了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:32.167+09:00">不知道轻重，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:36.142+09:00">就会把重的看轻了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:41.05+09:00">把轻的看重了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:45.734+09:00">这样一来，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:49.46+09:00">任何行动都会归于失败。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:29:57.071+09:00">这样的人做君主，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:30:46.207+09:00">做人臣，就会犯上作乱；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:30:55.321+09:00">为人子，就会狂放无礼， </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:31:14.359+09:00">这三种情况只要有一种在一个国家里出现，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T17:31:36.579+09:00">那它就要无可幸免地灭亡。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:21:33.117+09:00">假如有这样一种声音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:04.55+09:00">耳朵听到它一定会感到偃意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:12.167+09:00">但听了之后就会使人耳聋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:16.391+09:00">人们肯定不去听它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:20.24+09:00">假如有这样一种颜色，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:34.552+09:00">眼晴看到它一定会感到偃意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:37.892+09:00">但看了之后就会使人眼瞎，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:42.055+09:00">人们肯定不去看它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:48.55+09:00">假如有这样一种食物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:51.719+09:00">嘴巴吃到它一定会感到恨意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:22:57.561+09:00">但吃了之后就会使人变成哑巴，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:00.214+09:00">人们肯定不去吃它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:18.884+09:00">因此，圣人对于声音、颜色、滋味的态度是，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:21.837+09:00">有利于生命的就取用，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:25.391+09:00">有害于生命的就舍弃，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:29.792+09:00">这是保全生命的正确方法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:34.483+09:00">世上富贵的人</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:23:41.114+09:00">对于声色滋味的认识大多是糊涂的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:24:02.998+09:00">他们日夜不停地追求这些东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:25:11.197+09:00">有幸得到了，就放纵自己，沉溺其中而不能自拔。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:25:13.785+09:00">溺其中不能自拔，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:25:35.777+09:00">怎能不伤害生命的天性呢？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:37:37.098+09:00">假如一万个人拿着弓箭，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T19:37:40.774+09:00">共同射向一个靶子，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:18:35.711+09:00">靶子绝不会射不中。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:18:51.734+09:00">如果用它们伤害一个生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:19:24.133+09:00">那个生命绝不会不受伤害；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:19:33.735+09:00">万物美好而明丽，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:20:17.471+09:00">而如果用来为一个生命提供便利，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:20:35.709+09:00">那个生命肯定会长寿。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:22:26.424+09:00">所以，圣人支配万物</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:22:27.398+09:00">来保全自己的生命。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:22:35.816+09:00">生命全然无损，精神就和谐了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:24:52.442+09:00">眼晴就明亮了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:00.941+09:00">耳朵就灵敏了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:07.605+09:00">嗅觉就敏伉了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:17.591+09:00">口齿就伶俐了，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:25.693+09:00">全身三百六十个骨节就都通畅舒展了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:30.02+09:00">这样的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:33.416+09:00">不用说话就能取信于人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:42.682+09:00">不用谋划一切举止都会得当， </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:44.989+09:00">不用思考就会有所得。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:49.413+09:00">他们的精神通达天地，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:25:57.576+09:00">覆盖宇宙。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:22.409+09:00">对于外物，他们没有不能承受</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:28.317+09:00">与包容的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:31.4+09:00">如同天地一样。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:34.933+09:00">贵为天子也不骄傲．</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:42.084+09:00">身为普通黎民百姓也不烦忧。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:26:42.543+09:00">这才称得上是德行完美的人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:05.849+09:00">富贵而不懂得养生之道，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:11.786+09:00">反而会带来祸患，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:14.716+09:00">那就不如贫贱。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:22.216+09:00">贫贱的人荻得东西很难，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:31.631+09:00">即使想沉汤于物质享受之中，又怎么可能呢？ </seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:50.84+09:00">出门乘车，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:55.06+09:00">进门坐辇，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:27:59.428+09:00">务求安逸舒适，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:28:11.776+09:00">这样的车辇应该叫“招致腿脚疾病的器械＂。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:28:22.366+09:00">吃肥肉，喝醇酒，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:28:25.94+09:00">耽于厚味，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:02.974+09:00">这样的酒肉应该叫“腐烂肠道的食物”。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:11.606+09:00">迷恋女色，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:19.991+09:00">沉醉于靡靡之音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:26.321+09:00">极尽享乐之能事，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:33.585+09:00">这样的美色、音乐</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:37.222+09:00">应该叫“找害性命的斧头” 。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:43.143+09:00">这三种祸患都是富贵所招致的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:29:59.332+09:00">所以古代就有摒弃富贵的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T23:56:21.956+09:00">这是出于对生命的重视，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:31:57.462+09:00">而不是为了自我夸耀以钓取虚名，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:32:00.74+09:00">他们为的是保全生命。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-14a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-08T21:32:01.775+09:00">因此，对这个道理必须要加以明察。重已</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
